{comment: Chorus}
[A]You are worthy, [D]you are worthy, [A]you are worthy, O [Bm]God. [E]
[A]You are worthy [D]to receive from us [A]praise and [E7]honor and [A]thanks.

{comment: Verse 1}
[E]For you made all things and [A]through you life came to be;
[Bm]in you were the will and [E7]the power. [A]
[A]You alone are worthy [A7]to receive from [D]us
[E]praise and [E7]honor and [A]thanks!

{comment: Chorus}
